Rule 8 (tensor must have an integer dtype: 1–5)
{v1: tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype(v1) ∧ dtype(v1) ≤ 5

Rule 9 (4D tensor with all shape dimensions positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 3] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 10 (valid 2D transposed convolution)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int, v_4 : int} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 4 ∧ v_3 ≥ 1 ∧ v_4 ≥ 0 ∧ v_3 × (shape(v_1, 2) − 1) + shape(v_2, 2) − 2 × v_4 > 0 ∧ v_3 × (shape(v_1, 3) − 1) + shape(v_2, 3) − 2 × v_4 > 0

Rule 2 (v_2 should be a valid dimension of input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= −1 × ndim(v_1) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 ≤ ndim(v_1) − 1

Rule 31 (dtype must be a floating-point type)
{v_1 : dtype} |= v_1 = 6 ∨ v_1 = 7 ∨ v_1 = 8

